msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelgroup.rst:23 6bd9cba8e77240dc80571a58a4f8a09c
msgid ""
"FmodChannelGroup is used to organize multiple channels into a group for collective control. It "
"extends :ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`, inheriting all its functionality "
"including volume control, panning, DSP effects, and sample-accurate scheduling."
msgstr ""
"**FmodChannelGroup**    表示 FMOD 的 ChannelGroup，可作为多个 Channel 或子 ChannelGroup "
"的输入目标。它继承通用的播放、音量、DSP 和调度控制能力，适合用于分组混音、总线式控制和批量停止声音。 （参见   "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`  ）"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelgroup.rst:25 f2635edde35d4592adfcfd6a5f9fe040
msgid ""
"Channel groups form a hierarchical tree structure where each group can contain channels and other"
" groups. Audio from all child channels and groups flows through the parent group, allowing for "
"complex mixing hierarchies. The root of this tree is the master channel group, accessible via "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()<class_FmodServer_method_get_master_channel_group>`."
msgstr ""
"通道组形成层级树，每个组可以包含通道和其他组。所有子通道和子组的音频流向父组。根节点为主通道组，可通过    "
":ref:`FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()<class_FmodServer_method_get_master_channel_group>`"
"    获取。"

