"group when it is the parent. Returns ``null`` if there is no parent or the query fails."
msgstr "返回当前组输出到的父  **FmodChannelGroup** ，父级为主通道组时也会返回该组。没有父级或查询失败时返回  ``null`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodchannelgroup.rst:214 330df6adab1b43cfa1108ae121600b5a
msgid ""
